# E00 SendingObjects: parallel, the two agents interleave differently at each run; compared: what each agent sends and
# receives, in order, the counts, and the turn barrier (every send of the setup turn before the receptions of turn 1).
cover all
fact sending ^(a1\*|a2) sending: (.*)$
fact receiving ^(a1\*|a2) receiving: (.*)$
fact phase ^(?:a1\*|a2) (sending|receiving)
same sending seq by 0
same receiving seq by 0
same phase seq
check sending count == 13
check receiving count == 13
fact error (Exception|out of range)
optional error
check error count == 0
